OL,3,CA look back at how the South marked
OL,4,Cthe 1999 solar eclipse
OL,6,FSkygazers will be gathering across the
OL,7,FSouth and South East on Wednesday
OL,8,Fevening (12 August) to experience the
OL,9,Ffullest solar eclipse since 1999.
OL,11,FThe Moon will pass between the Sun and
OL,12,Fthe Earth between 6pm and 8pm, and
OL,13,Fbriefly all three celestial bodies
OL,14,Fwill be aligned.
OL,16,FUp to 96% of the Sun could be obscured
OL,17,Fin parts of the country.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
