OL,3,CA look back at how the South marked
OL,4,Cthe 1999 solar eclipse
OL,6,FThe last time the UK saw a solar
OL,7,Feclipse this impressive was on August
OL,8,F11, 1999, the most widely-viewed
OL,9,Feclipse in history.
OL,11,FITV News Meridian covered the event
OL,12,Fwhich saw thousands gather across the
OL,13,FSouth and South East.
OL,15,FAt Marwell Zoo in Hampshire, animals
OL,16,Fwere confused with birds heading into
OL,17,Fthe trees to roost as the skies
OL,18,Fdarkened.
OL,20,FOther animals started lying down as
OL,21,Fthe temperatures dropped.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
