OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1786553276
OL,3,CA look back at how the South marked
OL,4,Cthe 1999 solar eclipse
OL,6,FIn Chieveley, West Berkshire, children
OL,7,Fwere entertained inside where they
OL,8,Fwatched the eclipse on TV to protect
OL,9,Ftheir eyes from the glare of the sun.
OL,11,FPeople weren't only watching on land,
OL,12,Fthe solar eclipse sparked one of
OL,13,FBritain's biggest ever maritime
OL,14,Fgatherings.
OL,16,FThousands of boats set sail to view
OL,17,Fthe eclipse from the sea.
OL,19,FThe 1999 solar eclipse created the
OL,20,Fbiggest power surge the national grid
OL,21,Fhad ever seen.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
