OL,3,CA look back at how the South marked
OL,4,Cthe 1999 solar eclipse
OL,6,FMany retailers have sold out of the
OL,7,Fglasses, but there are alternative
OL,8,Fways to watch the phenomenon without
OL,9,Flooking at the Sun, including
OL,10,Flivestreams, DIY pinhole viewers and
OL,11,Feven colanders.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/5
